      "paperId": "79109869e452b18d7958e0cdf910addf13504071",
      "title": "Occult Surrealism as \u201cProfane Illumination\u201d: Mina Loy, Leonora Carrington, and Ithell Colquhoun",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Walter B. Kalaidjian",
